# Test your FastAPI endpoints
### Test Case 1: Submit a Full Onboarding Form (Success)
### Submit a Comprehensive Onboarding Form Request
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/onboarding
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": {
    "name": "Jane Doe",
    "company": "Acme Corp",
    "email": "jane@example.com",
    "phone": "555-0199"
  },
  "brief": {
    "business_summary": "A boutique e-commerce shop specializing in handmade pottery.",
    "target_audience": "Local art collectors and home decor enthusiasts aged 25-50.",
    "competitors": "Etsy shops, local boutique stores",
    "primary_goal": "Build a lightning-fast, highly accessible online store.",
    "required_features": ["shopping_cart", "stripe_payments", "admin_dashboard"],
    "accessibility_requirements": "Strict WCAG 2.1 AA compliance, screen-reader optimized elements, high-contrast layouts.",
    "timeline": "6-8 weeks",
    "budget_range": "$3,000 - $5,000"
  }
}

### Test Case 2: Validation Failure Check (Invalid Email Format)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/onboarding
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": {
    "name": "Bad Email Tester",
    "email": "not-a-valid-email",
    "phone": "555-0000"
  },
  "brief": {
    "business_summary": "Testing Pydantic validation.",
    "target_audience": "Developers",
    "primary_goal": "Trigger a 422 Unprocessable Entity error",
    "required_features": ["test"],
    "timeline": "Immediate",
    "budget_range": "N/A"
  }
}

